13:35.160 --> 13:36.390
Jadi, apa pendapat awak?

13:38.270 --> 13:39.840
Tak apa, kata saja jika ada pendapat.

13:42.780 --> 13:43.620
Pengarah Meng.

13:44.250 --> 13:45.810
Penghantar Bee Hungry kini gunakan

13:45.870 --> 13:47.030
